    ["他是“星之女王”嘉德丽雅麾下的大副，“未来号”上令人闻风丧胆的“毒素专家”。但弗兰克·李从不认为自己是危险人物——他只是一个热爱土壤、作物和品种杂交技术的农业研究者，一个试图用最直接的方式解决人类饥饿问题的理想主义者。\n在他的世界里，公牛与小麦之间没有不可逾越的鸿沟，牛奶与甲板之间也不存在本质的区别。万物皆可杂交，一切皆有可能。这是他对“母亲”的意志最为虔诚的解读。\n\n弗兰克·李的疯狂，是一种纯粹的、近乎天真的疯狂。他从不觉得自己在做危险的事，就像孩子从不觉得把积木搭成奇怪形状有什么不对。他只是看见了饥饿，看见了贫困，然后想出了一个最直接的解决方案——让食物自己长出来，以任何可能的形式，在任何可能的地方。\n他试图让牛像麦子一样从地里长出来，这样农民就不需要费心饲养；他培育的蘑菇在“未来号”的甲板下疯狂繁殖，让这艘船开始产奶——对他来说，这是“神迹”，是“仁慈的母亲”对他研究的肯定。他从未想过，一个普通人看见甲板缝隙里渗出乳白色液体时，第一反应会是恐惧而非惊喜。\n他是“未来号”上最危险的存在，却也是最无害的灵魂。危险的是他的造物，无害的是他的心。他从不怀有任何恶意，他站在疯狂与天真之间那条模糊的边界上，他坚信，总有一天，世界会理解他的。\n\n“我只是想喂饱所有人。”他会这样说，蓝色的眼睛里满是真诚。"] = "He is the First mate under the command of the “Queen of Stars” Cattleya, and the dreaded “Toxin Expert” on the Future. But Frank Lee never considered himself a dangerous person—he is just an agricultural researcher who loves soil, crops, and cross-breeding technology, an idealist who tries to solve human hunger in the most direct way. \n In his world, there is no insurmountable gap between bulls and wheat, and there is no essential difference between milk and the deck. Everything can be hybridized, and anything is possible. This is his most devout interpretation of the “Mother’s” will. \n \n Frank Lee’s madness is a pure, almost naive madness. He never feels that he is doing something dangerous, just as a child never feels that there is anything wrong with building blocks into strange shapes. He just saw hunger, saw poverty, and then came up with the most direct solution—let food grow itself, in any possible form, in any possible place. \n He tried to make cows grow out of the ground like wheat so that farmers wouldn’t need to worry about raising them; the mushrooms he cultivated reproduced wildly under the deck of the Future, making the ship start to produce milk—to him, this is a “miracle,” a confirmation of his research by the “merciful Mother.” He never thought that when an ordinary person saw milky white liquid seeping out of the cracks in the deck, the first reaction would be fear rather than surprise. \n He is the most dangerous existence on the Future, but also the most harmless soul. What is dangerous is his creation, and what is harmless is his heart. He never harbors any malice; he stands on the blurred boundary between madness and innocence, and he firmly believes that one day, the world will understand him. \n \n “I just want to feed everyone.” He would say this, his blue eyes full of sincerity.",
